<Shell title="Run deals on Lotmates as a vendor" description="Local businesses get batches of paid jobs in one community. Neighbours book together and pay upfront; you're paid weekly. Every vendor is checked before approval. Apply to join.">
  <h1>Run deals on Lotmates</h1>
  <p>Neighbours book your service together, the price drops for everyone, and you get a batch of paid jobs in one area.</p>
  <h2>How a deal works</h2>
  <ol>
    <li>Agree the price tiers, minimum homes, capacity and service window with our team.</li>
    <li>Neighbours book and pay upfront through Razorpay.</li>
    <li>The deal closes at the final price, or every neighbour is refunded.</li>
    <li>You do the jobs and mark them done with photos.</li>
    <li>You're paid weekly after a 7-day complaint window, minus the agreed commission.</li>
  </ol>
  <h2>How we check every vendor</h2>
  <p>ID proof, licences for the trade, references from past customers, a test job and a verified bank account. New vendors start on probation.</p>
  <p>Read the <a href="/legal/vendors">vendor terms</a>.</p>
</Shell>
